## Article 124. Summons to court

```catala
declaration scope Article124Summons:
  input delivery content DocumentDelivery
  output summonsProperlyServed content YesNo

scope Article124Summons:
  label served_default definition summonsProperlyServed equals No

# Personal delivery is always proper
  label served_personal exception served_default
  definition summonsProperlyServed under condition
    delivery.method = PersonalDelivery
    and delivery.deliverySuccessful = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

# Registered mail with confirmation
  label served_mail exception served_default
  definition summonsProperlyServed under condition
    delivery.method = RegisteredMail
    and delivery.deliverySuccessful = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

# Electronic delivery with confirmation
  label served_electronic exception served_default
  definition summonsProperlyServed under condition
    delivery.method = ElectronicDelivery
    and delivery.deliverySuccessful = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

# Via representative
  label served_representative exception served_default
  definition summonsProperlyServed under condition
    delivery.method = ViaRepresentative
    and delivery.deliverySuccessful = Yes
    consequence equals Yes
```

## Article 125. Content of summons

```catala
declaration scope Article125SummonsContent:
  input summonsContainsCourtName content YesNo
  input summonsContainsCaseNumber content YesNo
  input summonsContainsHearingDate content YesNo
  input summonsContainsHearingTime content YesNo
  input summonsContainsHearingPlace content YesNo
  input summonsContainsCaseSummary content YesNo
  input summonsContainsRightsNotice content YesNo
  output summonsMeetsRequirements content YesNo

scope Article125SummonsContent:
  label requirements_default definition summonsMeetsRequirements equals No

  label requirements_met exception requirements_default
  definition summonsMeetsRequirements under condition
    summonsContainsCourtName = Yes
    and summonsContainsCaseNumber = Yes
    and summonsContainsHearingDate = Yes
    and summonsContainsHearingTime = Yes
    and summonsContainsHearingPlace = Yes
    and summonsContainsCaseSummary = Yes
    and summonsContainsRightsNotice = Yes
    consequence equals Yes
```

## Article 126. Service of summons to participants

```catala
declaration scope Article126SummonsService:
  input delivery content DocumentDelivery
  input sufficientTimeBeforeHearing content YesNo
  output summonsTimelyServed content YesNo

scope Article126SummonsService:
  label timely_default definition summonsTimelyServed equals No

  label timely_served exception timely_default
  definition summonsTimelyServed under condition
    delivery.deliverySuccessful = Yes
    and sufficientTimeBeforeHearing = Yes
    consequence equals Yes
```

## Article 127. Deemed service

```catala
declaration scope Article127DeemedService:
  input delivery content DocumentDelivery
  input addresseeRefusedAcceptance content YesNo
  input addresseeNotAtAddress content YesNo
  input noticeLeftAtAddress content YesNo
  output deemedProperlyServed content YesNo

scope Article127DeemedService:
  label deemed_default definition deemedProperlyServed equals No

# Refusal to accept counts as service
  label deemed_refused exception deemed_default
  definition deemedProperlyServed under condition
    addresseeRefusedAcceptance = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

# Notice left at address when addressee absent
  label deemed_notice exception deemed_default
  definition deemedProperlyServed under condition
    addresseeNotAtAddress = Yes
    and noticeLeftAtAddress = Yes
    consequence equals Yes
```

## Article 128. Court notice board

```catala
declaration scope Article128NoticeBoard:
  input delivery content DocumentDelivery
  input addresseeLocationUnknown content YesNo
  output canPostOnNoticeBoard content YesNo

scope Article128NoticeBoard:
  label notice_default definition canPostOnNoticeBoard equals No

  label notice_exception exception notice_default
  definition canPostOnNoticeBoard under condition
    addresseeLocationUnknown = Yes
    consequence equals Yes
```

## Article 129. Electronic service

```catala
declaration scope Article129ElectronicService:
  input delivery content DocumentDelivery
  input addresseeConsentedToElectronic content YesNo
  output electronicServiceValid content YesNo

scope Article129ElectronicService:
  label electronic_default definition electronicServiceValid equals No

  label electronic_consented exception electronic_default
  definition electronicServiceValid under condition
    delivery.method = ElectronicDelivery
    and addresseeConsentedToElectronic = Yes
    consequence equals Yes
```

## Articles 130-131. Consequences of failure to appear

```catala
declaration scope Article130FailureToAppear:
  input summonsProperlyServed content YesNo
  input plaintiffFailedToAppear content YesNo
  input defendantFailedToAppear content YesNo
  input plaintiffRequestedInAbsence content YesNo
  output caseCanBeHeardInAbsence content YesNo
  output caseCanLeaveWithoutConsideration content YesNo

scope Article130FailureToAppear:
# If properly summoned, case can proceed without absent party
  label hear_in_absence_default definition caseCanBeHeardInAbsence equals No

  label hear_plaintiff_absent exception hear_in_absence_default
  definition caseCanBeHeardInAbsence under condition
    plaintiffFailedToAppear = Yes
    and summonsProperlyServed = Yes
    and plaintiffRequestedInAbsence = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label hear_defendant_absent exception hear_in_absence_default
  definition caseCanBeHeardInAbsence under condition
    defendantFailedToAppear = Yes
    and summonsProperlyServed = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

# Case can be left without consideration if plaintiff absent without cause
  label leave_default definition caseCanLeaveWithoutConsideration equals No

  label leave_exception exception leave_default
  definition caseCanLeaveWithoutConsideration under condition
    plaintiffFailedToAppear = Yes
    and summonsProperlyServed = Yes
    and plaintiffRequestedInAbsence = No
    consequence equals Yes
```
